---
// FaqAcordeon.astro — extraído de Faq.astro
---

  <!-- ==============================================
       COLUMNA DERECHA: ACORDEÓN CON LAS 8 PREGUNTAS
       ============================================== -->
  <div class="faq-accordion-col" role="region" aria-label="Lista de preguntas frecuentes">
    <div class="accordion-list" id="faq-accordion" data-reveal="card">
      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 01 (Abierta por defecto)
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="true">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-1"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="true"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-1"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">01</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿Qué es DECA Light?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-1"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-1"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              DECA Light es una solución digital orientada a facilitar la coordinación de la documentación de transporte y la información asociada a las expediciones en empresas hortofrutícolas.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 02
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="false">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-2"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-2"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">02</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿Qué problema busca resolver?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-2"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-2"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              Busca ayudar a organizar la información documental de las expediciones y reducir la fricción derivada de gestionar datos y documentos procedentes de distintas fuentes y personas.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 03
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="false">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-3"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-3"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">03</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿Para qué tipo de empresas está pensado?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-3"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-3"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              Está orientado principalmente a almacenes y comercializadoras hortofrutícolas que coordinan expediciones de forma habitual y necesitan organizar la información relacionada con sus documentos de transporte.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 04
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="false">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-4"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-4"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">04</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿Qué documentación contempla?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-4"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-4"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              DECA Light trabaja con el informe de expediciones de tu ERP y con las cartas de porte en PDF, y prepara el documento de control (DeCA) de cada expedición, con su PDF y su código QR. Si quieres saber qué exige la norma, consulta nuestra <a href="/guia-deca">guía del DeCA</a>.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 05
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="false">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-5"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-5"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">05</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿DECA Light sustituye a nuestro ERP?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-5"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-5"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              DECA Light está concebido como una herramienta de apoyo a la coordinación documental, no como un sustituto general del ERP. El encaje con los sistemas y procesos existentes debe estudiarse para cada caso.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 06
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="false">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-6"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-6"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">06</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿Cómo podemos saber si encaja con nuestra operativa?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-6"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-6"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              El primer paso es conocer cómo gestionáis actualmente las expediciones, qué información utilizáis y dónde aparecen las principales dificultades. A partir de ahí te enseñamos en una demostración cómo encaja DECA Light con vuestra forma de trabajar.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 07
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="false">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-7"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-7"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">07</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿Es necesario cambiar nuestro proceso de trabajo?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-7"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-7"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              No. DECA Light se adapta a vuestra operativa: importa la información que ya tenéis y solo os pide lo que falta, normalmente la matrícula del camión. Hoy importa el informe de expediciones de determinados ERP; consúltanos si trabajáis con otro.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>

      <!-- --------------------------------------------
           PREGUNTA 08
           -------------------------------------------- -->
      <article class="accordion-item" data-open="false">
        <div class="accordion-accent-bar" aria-hidden="true"></div>
        <h3>
          <button
            type="button"
            id="faq-btn-8"
            class="faq-toggle"
            aria-expanded="false"
            aria-controls="faq-ans-8"
          >
            <div class="toggle-left">
              <span class="faq-num">08</span>
              <span class="faq-title">¿Cómo puedo ver DECA Light funcionando?</span>
            </div>
            <svg width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="accordion-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
              <polyline points="6 9 12 15 18 9"></polyline>
            </svg>
          </button>
        </h3>
        <div
          id="faq-ans-8"
          class="accordion-content"
          role="region"
          aria-labelledby="faq-btn-8"
        >
          <div class="accordion-inner">
            <div class="answer-body">
              Solicita una demostración desde el formulario o escríbenos a contacto@decalight.es. Te enseñamos DECA Light con un caso como el tuyo y, si encaja, te acompañamos en la puesta en marcha.
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </article>
    </div>
  </div>

<style>
  .animate-stagger-1 {
      animation: fadeInUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.08s both;
    }
  .animate-stagger-2 {
      animation: fadeInUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.18s both;
    }
  .animate-stagger-3 {
      animation: fadeInUp 0.7s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1) 0.28s both;
    }
  .faq-accordion-col {
      width: 100%;
      max-width: 100%;
    }
  .accordion-list {
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      gap: 0.75rem;
    }
  .accordion-item {
      position: relative;
      background-color: var(--palette-white);
      border: 1px solid var(--palette-slate-200);
      border-radius: 0.875rem;
      overflow: hidden;
      transition: all 0.24s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
      box-shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.03);
    }
  .accordion-item:hover {
      border-color: var(--palette-slate-300);
    }
  .accordion-accent-bar {
      position: absolute;
      left: 0;
      top: 0;
      bottom: 0;
      width: 4px;
      background-color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      opacity: 0;
      transition: opacity 0.2s ease;
    }
  .accordion-item[data-open="true"] {
      background-color: #FAFFFC;
      border-color: var(--palette-emerald-200);
      box-shadow: 0 4px 20px -2px rgba(8, 84, 62, 0.06);
    }
  .accordion-item[data-open="true"] .accordion-accent-bar {
      opacity: 1;
    }
  .faq-toggle {
      width: 100%;
      padding: 1rem 1.25rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: space-between;
      text-align: left;
      background: none;
      border: none;
      cursor: pointer;
      gap: 1rem;
      font-family: inherit;
      transition: background-color 0.15s ease;
    }
  .faq-toggle:focus-visible {
      outline: none;
      box-shadow: inset 0 0 0 2px var(--palette-deca-800);
    }
  .toggle-left {
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      gap: 0.875rem;
    }
  .faq-num {
      font-family: var(--font-mono, monospace);
      font-size: 0.8125rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      color: var(--palette-slate-600);
      background-color: var(--palette-slate-100);
      width: 2rem;
      height: 2rem;
      border-radius: 0.5rem;
      display: flex;
      align-items: center;
      justify-content: center;
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: all 0.2s ease;
    }
  .accordion-item[data-open="true"] .faq-num {
      color: var(--palette-deca-800);
      background-color: var(--palette-deca-50);
    }
  .faq-title {
      font-size: 0.9375rem;
      font-weight: 700;
      line-height: 1.35;
      color: var(--palette-slate-900);
      transition: color 0.2s ease;
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .faq-title {
          font-size: 1rem;
        }
  }
  .accordion-chevron {
      color: var(--palette-slate-400);
      flex-shrink: 0;
      transition: transform 0.3s cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), color 0.2s ease;
    }
  .accordion-item[data-open="true"] .accordion-chevron {
      transform: rotate(180deg);
      color: var(--palette-deca-800);
    }
  .accordion-content {
      display: grid;
      grid-template-rows: 0fr;
      transition: grid-template-rows 300ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  .accordion-item[data-open="true"] .accordion-content {
      grid-template-rows: 1fr;
    }
  .accordion-inner {
      overflow: hidden;
      opacity: 0;
      transform: translateY(-4px);
      transition: opacity 240ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1), transform 240ms cubic-bezier(0.16, 1, 0.3, 1);
    }
  .accordion-item[data-open="true"] .accordion-inner {
      opacity: 1;
      transform: translateY(0);
      transition-delay: 60ms;
    }
  :global(html:not(.js)) .accordion-content {
      grid-template-rows: 1fr !important;
    }
  :global(html:not(.js)) .accordion-inner {
      opacity: 1 !important;
      transform: none !important;
      overflow: visible !important;
    }
  :global(html:not(.js)) .accordion-chevron {
      display: none !important;
    }
  .answer-body {
      padding: 0.25rem 1.25rem 1.25rem;
      font-size: 0.875rem;
      line-height: 1.6;
      color: var(--palette-slate-700);
      border-top: 1px solid rgba(241, 245, 249, 0.9);
    }
  @media (min-width: 640px) {
    .answer-body {
          font-size: 0.90625rem;
          padding-left: 4.125rem;
          padding-right: 1.5rem;
        }
  }
  @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
    *, ::before, ::after {
          animation-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          animation-iteration-count: 1 !important;
          transition-duration: 0.001ms !important;
          scroll-behavior: auto !important;
        }
    .accordion-content,
        .accordion-inner,
        .accordion-chevron {
          transition: none !important;
        }
  }

  @keyframes fadeInUp {
      from {
        opacity: 0;
        transform: translateY(20px);
      }
      to {
        opacity: 1;
        transform: translateY(0);
      }
    }
</style>
